      "settings": {
        "about_kicker": "Who We Are",
        "about_lead": "For more than three decades, EZQuest has helped people navigate every major evolution in computer connectivity. From the early days of SCSI to today’s USB-C, Thunderbolt, and USB4 technologies, we’ve remained committed to one mission: designing products that make technology easier, smarter, and more reliable.",
        "about_body": "<p>Founded in 1994 by electronics engineer Ebrahim Zmehrir, EZQuest was built on a simple philosophy: listen first, design second. Rather than following market trends, we believe every product should solve a genuine customer problem.</p><p>During the FireWire era, EZQuest became one of the industry’s early innovators, helping creative professionals transition to digital video editing. Our products were showcased by Apple at Macworld San Francisco.</p><p>Today, EZQuest designs premium USB-C and Thunderbolt accessories including hubs, docking stations, adapters, cables, power solutions, and productivity accessories for users around the world.</p><p>Every product begins with one simple question: What problem are we solving? If we cannot improve the customer experience, we simply don’t build the product.</p><p>We believe innovation isn’t about adding more features. It’s about adding the right features. At EZQuest, engineering always comes before marketing.</p>",
        "about_closer": "While technology will continue to change, our philosophy never will. We listen. We innovate. We improve. And above all, we strive to earn something far more valuable than a sale, we strive to earn your trust.",
